; What a bare `dune build` builds.
;
; Left implicit, the root's default alias is every installable target, which
; reaches the libraries, the executable and the test suites but not assets/ —
; there is nothing to install there, deliberately: an opam prefix is not a
; layout Asset knows how to search, and packaging the pictures into a .app or
; an AppImage is E13's job.
;
; The pictures still have to reach _build, because that is where Asset finds
; them: one directory above the executable, which under dune is _build/default.
; So the alias is spelled out, and `dune build` is the whole repository rather
; than only the parts of it opam would carry.

(alias
 (name default)
 (deps
  (alias_rec all)
  (source_tree assets)))
